  "description": "INUKUA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C169 H149 N6 O34 Tb7,6(C1 H1 Cl3),3(H2 O1),3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.787-3.856 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.71-111.59°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb7(L)2(LH)4(dbm)5(OH)2(CH3OH)4]·6CHCl3·3CH3OH·3H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
